---
---

<header class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-top-meta">
    <span>Puerto Montt, Región de Los Lagos &bull; 41°28′ S</span>
    <span class="status-indicator">
      <span class="status-dot"></span>
      Disponible para proyectos
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-main">
    <h1 class="hero-name">Felipe Godoy Pérez</h1>
    <p class="hero-role">Desarrollo Web, Backend &amp; Hardware en Terreno</p>

    <p class="hero-bio">
      Desarrollo aplicaciones web con <strong>Django</strong> y <strong>Astro</strong>, plataformas de comercio electrónico y módulos de mapas en tiempo real. En paralelo diseño sistemas embebidos de bajo consumo (RP2040, ESP32) para muestreo acústico y monitoreo biológico en terreno.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-links">
      <a href="#proyectos" class="hero-btn primary-btn">
        Ver proyectos
        <span class="btn-arrow">&darr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="#contacto" class="hero-btn secondary-btn">
        Contactar
      </a>

      <div class="direct-access">
        <button class="hero-btn text-btn copy-btn" data-copy-email="felipegp90@gmail.com" type="button" title="Copiar correo">
          <span>felipegp90@gmail.com</span>
          <span class="copy-hint">[Copiar]</span>
        </button>

        <a href="https://github.com/felipooon" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hero-btn text-btn">
          <span>github.com/felipooon</span>
          <span class="ext-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    padding-top: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
  }

  .hero-top-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .status-indicator {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #22c55e;
  }

  .hero-main {
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 3.25rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .hero-role {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-bio {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .hero-bio strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .primary-btn {
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 1px solid var(--text);
  }

  .primary-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .btn-arrow {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .secondary-btn {
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .secondary-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    background: var(--surface-hover);
  }

  .direct-access {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .text-btn {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
  }

  .text-btn:hover {
    color: var(--text);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .copy-hint {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .ext-arrow {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-name { font-size: 2.35rem; }
    .hero-top-meta { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .hero-links { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .direct-access { margin-left: 0; flex-direction: column; }
    .hero-btn { justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
